{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12137","headline":"蓝溪休沐寄赵八给事 · 钱起","name":"蓝溪休沐寄赵八给事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虫鸣归旧里，田野秋农闲。\n即事敦夙尚，衡门方再关。\n夕阳入东篱，爽气高前山。\n霜蕙後时老，巢禽知暝还。\n侍臣黄枢宠，鸣玉青云间。\n肯想观鱼处，寒泉照发斑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}